(Root cause) Tj T*
(A change merged two days earlier removed a safety limit, so disk full on the log volume was) Tj T*
(able to build up unnoticed until peak traffic. Monitoring did not alert early because the) Tj T*
(threshold was set for the old traffic pattern.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Contributing factors) Tj T*
(- The runbook pointed to a dashboard that had been renamed.) Tj T*
(- The canary stage was skipped for a config-only change.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Action items) Tj T*
(- AI-489: restore the safety limit and add a regression test.) Tj T*
(- AI-384: update the alert threshold to the new traffic pattern.) Tj T*
